  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Edo5jnW.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/可用於-Minecraft 1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-用戶端與伺服器端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 介紹：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>尖刺尖刺</strong>增加了許多真正尖銳的尖刺。這些尖刺分為多個等級，每個等級都有獨特的能力。那你還在等什麼？快去改進你的生怪塔吧！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">尖刺尖刺為您帶來 <strong>6 個等級</strong>的尖刺，每一種都獨一無二。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木製：</strong>緩慢傷害生物，但不會造成致命一擊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>石製：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，但不會掉落任何戰利品或經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵製：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，僅會掉落一般戰利品，無經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黃金製：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，僅會掉落經驗值，無任何戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石製：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物會掉落所有戰利品，如同被玩家殺死。可使用大部分劍類附魔，透過鐵砧來施加。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>獄髓製：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物會掉落所有戰利品，如同被玩家殺死。可使用大部分劍類附魔，透過鐵砧來施加。具有抗爆炸性，不會被凋零怪 Boss 破壞；且不會對玩家造成傷害。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>在為鑽石和獄髓尖刺添加附魔時，請務必將所有要附魔的尖刺一次準備好。您可以將附魔書應用於<strong>整疊尖刺</strong>上，因此之後再為個別尖刺附魔會不必要地消耗您更多的珍貴書籍。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/957/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/958/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尖刺尖刺非常尖銳</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>木製尖刺能將生物打至半顆心</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/959/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/960/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>即使是凋零怪 Boss 也無法在獄髓尖刺下倖存</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>您可以為尖刺施加的所有附魔</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，然後直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實現在遊戲內直接編輯設定檔的功能。請在進入世界後執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;模組ID&gt;</code> 指令，選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於模組），然後點擊聊天中出現的檔名（以 .toml 結尾），即可在獨立的編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定將在幾秒後自動重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">尖刺尖刺的開發得益於以下人士的幫助與靈感：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 從其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 模組舊版本中的尖刺方塊獲得啟發，為本模組帶來靈感</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>XFactHD</strong></span></a> 教導我如何在 Minecraft 中渲染非方塊形狀的黑暗藝術</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALHMDQn.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
